    {
      "text": "book of the generations of Adam, Gen. 5:1. Moses, Write this for a memorial in a book, Ex. 17:14. all the curses that are written in this book, Deut. 29:20. this book of the law, and put it in … the ark, Deut. 31:26. This book of the law shall not depart, Josh. 1:8. written in the book of the law of Moses, Josh. 8:31. do all that is written in the book of the law, Josh. 23:6. Samuel … wrote it in a book, 1 Sam. 10:25. found the book of the law, 2 Kgs. 22:8 (2 Chr. 34:15). I will bring evil … even all the words of the book, 2 Kgs. 22:16 (2 Chr. 34:24). read … all the words of the book, 2 Kgs. 23:2 (2 Chr. 34:21). written in the book of the kings of Israel, 1 Chr. 9:1. inquire of the Lord … concerning the words of the book, 2 Chr. 34:21. find in the book of the records, Ezra 4:15. they read in the book of Moses, Neh. 13:1. written in the book of the chronicles, Esth. 2:23. Oh that my words … were printed in a book, Job 19:23. in the volume of the book it is written of me, Ps. 40:7 (Heb. 10:7). are they not in thy book, Ps. 56:8. of making many books there is no end, Eccl. 12:12. as the words of a book that is sealed, Isa. 29:11 (2 Ne. 27:11). deaf hear the words of the book, Isa. 29:18 (2 Ne. 27:29). note it in a book … for the time to come, Isa. 30:8. Seek ye out of the book of the Lord, Isa. 34:16. this book, which Jeremiah hath prophesied, Jer. 25:13. Take thee a roll of a book, and write therein, Jer. 36:2. Jeremiah wrote in a book all the evil, Jer. 51:60. a roll of a book was therein, Ezek. 2:9. the books were opened, Dan. 7:10 (Rev. 20:12). understood by books the number of the years, Dan. 9:2.",
